l well combined. Incorporate {m53346_1}, {m53346_2}, {m53346_3}, and {m53346_4} smoothly until evenly distributed.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Heavy Cream, Condensed Milk","creatorSecret":"Prep and measure heavy cream first—mise en place makes this dessert twice as fast."},{"stepNumber":2,"phaseLabel":"Build Flavor","title":"Fold In Flavorings & Mix-Ins","instructionTemplate":"Fold in the cereal and stir until evenly distributed throughout the mixture. Combine until completely smooth, uniform, and free of lumps before moving to the next stage.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Vanilla Extract, Grape Nut Cereal"},{"stepNumber":3,"phaseLabel":"Shape & Layer","title":"Cream Butter & Sugar Fluffy","instructionTemplate":"Pour the mixture into a freezer-safe container (such as a loaf pan). Lay plastic wrap on top of the ice cream to avoid freezer burn. Cover the container and freeze for at least 6 hours or until solid.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Heavy Cream"},{"stepNumber":4,"phaseLabel":"Bake / Chill","title":"Cream Butter & Sugar Fluffy","instructionTemplate":"Once frozen, let the ice cream sit at room temperature for a few minutes to soften slightly before scooping and serving. Chill or freeze until completely firm and set, then portion into 4 servings and store leftovers in an airtight container.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Heavy Cream","criticalTip":"Let set for 5–10 minutes before slicing or plating so the textures hold crisp and photogenic!","creatorSecret":"Pre-chill your serving bowls or glasses in the freezer for 10 minutes for instant cafe presentation."}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-53346","handle":"@baker_grape-nu","image":"./ai-images/grape-nut-ice-cream.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 8 mins!","rating":5}]}}]
